<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Training Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We use <span id="A1.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">verl</span> as the training framework<span id="footnote1" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">1</span>
            
            
            
          <a href="https://github.com/volcengine/verl" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter">https://github.com/volcengine/verl</a></span></span></span>.
Configurations for training CDE and baseline models are listed in Table <a href="#A1.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ Appendix A Training Details ‣ CDE: Curiosity-Driven Exploration for Efficient Reinforcement Learning in Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a>.</p>
</div>
